                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">REAL $425K PROPOSAL</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">TalentForge attrition engagement</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SITUATION + OBJECTIVES + MEASURES</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">34% attrition, $11M cost — get to under 12%</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"320\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">VALUE ANCHOR</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">$11M direct + $140M IPO valuation lift</text>\n                    <rect x=\"60\" y=\"460\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"220\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OPTION 1</text>\n                    <text x=\"220\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">$175,000</text>\n                    <text x=\"220\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Diagnostic only</text>\n                    <text x=\"220\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">8 weeks</text>\n                    <rect x=\"400\" y=\"460\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.2)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n                    <text x=\"560\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OPTION 2</text>\n                    <text x=\"560\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">$300,000</text>\n                    <text x=\"560\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">+ Implementation</text>\n                    <text x=\"560\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">6 months</text>\n                    <rect x=\"740\" y=\"460\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"900\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OPTION 3</text>\n                    <text x=\"900\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">$425,000</text>\n                    <text x=\"900\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">+ IPO narrative</text>\n                    <text x=\"900\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">12 months</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"700\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">TERMS</text>\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">50%/50% • Fee non-refundable • Net immediate</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"850\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Closed Option 3 in 9 days.</text>\n                </svg>",
                    "caption": "Two pages. Three options. Nine days."
