                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Where to invest pipeline hours</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THREE-PILLAR ENGINE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">REFERRALS — 60-70% close rate</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">SPEAKING — 20-30% close rate</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">CONTENT — 15-25% close rate</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"470\" width=\"900\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WHAT DOESN'T COMPOUND</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Cold outreach (1-2% reply)</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Trade booth presence</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">BDR hire (breaks solo model)</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"740\" width=\"700\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Compounding gravity beats</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">outbound effort.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Build the engine once; harvest for a decade.</text>\n                </svg>",
                    "caption": "Three pillars produce oversubscription"
